The code and documentation are MIT, above. The data the built site ships
carries its own terms: Natural Earth is public domain; the GSHHG shoreline
is LGPL-3.0-or-later, cut into cells by the build, with its copyright and
permission notice at geo/gshhg-licence.txt and the licence text at
geo/gshhg-copying-lesser.txt beside them. The package's SPDX expression,
`MIT AND LGPL-3.0-or-later`, names both. The scans and the font are
credited in ASSETS.md.
